            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "LOOP is a tranquil puzzle game, with a unique, simple, meditative feel.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNow includes a level generator with a possible 1 BILLION levels.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComplete each level by swapping the hexagon pieces until all the lines link up, revealing the final pattern.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLater levels introduce spinning pieces and colour changing pieces also!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInspired by Zen philosophy, the minimal UI has no timers, move limit or score; allowing you to just relax and focus.",
            "about_the_game": "LOOP is a tranquil puzzle game, with a unique, simple, meditative feel.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNow includes a level generator with a possible 1 BILLION levels.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComplete each level by swapping the hexagon pieces until all the lines link up, revealing the final pattern.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLater levels introduce spinning pieces and colour changing pieces also!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInspired by Zen philosophy, the minimal UI has no timers, move limit or score; allowing you to just relax and focus.",
            "short_description": "LOOP is a tranquil puzzle game, with a unique, simple, meditative feel. Inspired by Zen philosophy, the minimal UI has no timers, move limit or score; allowing you to just relax and focus. Includes over 1 BILLION Levels.",
